  "type": "Single",
  "description": "\"Destination Calabria\" is a song by Italian music producer Alex Gaudino with vocals by American singer Crystal Waters. It is the first single released from his debut album My Destination. The track is a mashup, taking the instrumental from Rune RK's \"Calabria\" and the vocals from Gaudino's and Waters' \"Destination Unknown\", both originally released in 2003. It was produced with the help of Maurizio Nari and Ronnie Milani, matching the saxophone riff from \"Calabria\" to Waters' voice.",
